                             Interface:** A digital isolator (U2) provides a galvanically isolated UART and Fault interface between the BMS IC (High Voltage) and an external host/microcontroller (Low                        
                             Voltage).\n    15\t    *   **Direct Interface:** A header is provided for direct, non-isolated connection to the BMS UART pins.\n    16\t\n    17\t7.  **NPN Power Supply:** An                   
                             external NPN transistor circuit is provided to regulate the `LDOIN` supply for the BMS IC, reducing power dissipation within the IC. This circuit is powered from the main `PWR`                  
                             rail.\n    18\t\n    19\t# Components Inventory\n    20\t\n    21\t**Integrated Circuits**\n    22\t*   **U1:** TI BQ79616PAPQ1 (16-Channel Battery Monitor)\n    23\t*   **U2:** TI              
